 'Changing contact details can look like a takeover. A calm, single attempt is best.',
 'A change of email or phone number followed by a login from a new device can look like a takeover and lead to a lock or a verification loop. Make sure codes reach the new details, log in once from the official app, and use the support form for your lock type. Send us the message if it loops.',
 [('Confirm the new details', 'Make sure the email and number actually receive messages.'),
  ('Avoid doing it all at once', 'A new number, phone and email together look riskier.'),
  ('Keep the old details if you can', 'They help with verification.')],
 ['A new email or number plus a new device.', 'Codes that do not arrive.', 'A VPN during the change.', 'An unconfirmed email on the account.'],
 ['Check that you receive mail and text on the new details.', 'Log in once from the official app.', 'Use the official support form for your lock type.', 'Send us the message if it loops.'],
 [('I lost access to the old email. What now?', 'Use the support form and describe the account. Tell us what you can show.'),
  ('Can I switch back?', 'If you still receive messages on the old details, yes. Change them once only.'),
  ('Do I need the old phone?', 'It helps with verification if you still have it.')],
