sc('snapchat-locked-for-harassment-report', 'Snapchat Locked After a Harassment Report',
 'Snapchat locked your account after a harassment report?', 'Locked after a harassment report',
 'Snapchat locked your account after reports of harassment or bullying? How the lock is read and what a fair appeal contains.',
 'A harassment lock often follows one or more reports. The appeal should be calm and factual.',
 'If Snapchat locked your account after harassment or bullying reports, read the message for the exact policy, look at what you sent and to whom, and write a short, factual appeal. If the reports were wrong, say so plainly and show context. Do not threaten or argue. Send us the message if the lock stays.',
 [('Read the policy named', 'It tells you what the lock is about.'),
  ('Be factual', 'State what happened and what you have changed.'),
  ('Do not contact the reporter', 'Messaging them can lead to further action.')],
 ['A report from another user.', 'Repeated messages after a block.', 'A group chat that was reported.', 'Earlier warnings on the account.'],
 ['Screenshot the lock message.', 'Note which chats may have been reported.', 'Write a short, factual appeal.', 'Send it to us for a clear review of the wording.'],
 [('Can a false report cause a lock?', 'Yes, but the appeal should still be calm and factual.'),
  ('Should I message the person?', 'No. Contacting them can make things worse.'),
  ('Will deleting chats help?', 'It does not unlock the account and can look worse.')],
 ['Users told the lock was for harassment.', 'People involved in a dispute.', 'Group chat admins.'])

